            <summary class="sw-faq-q">Are you cheaper than buying directly from the vendor?
              <svg class="sw-faq-icon" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none"><path d="M3 5l4 4 4-4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
